---
config:
  theme: neo
  look: handDrawn
  handDrawnSeed: 1
description: one representative usecase diagram, hand-drawn in the neo theme (D301, D319), actor glyphs, ovals, rects, the note and JSON frame (node), JSON cells (part), boundary frames and tab (group) and lines (edge) sketched through w.outline; business marks, arrowheads and text plain
---
usecase-beta
  direction LR
  actor Customer <<Human>>
  actor Clerk@{ business: true }
  actor Gateway@{ type: hollow }
  systemBoundary "Web shop"
    Browse("Browse catalogue")
    Checkout("Check out") <<Core>>
    Pay[Pay by card]
    Coupon("Apply coupon")
  end
  "Web shop"@{ type: package }
  systemBoundary "Back office"
    Refund("Refund order")@{ business: true }
  end
  Customer --> Browse
  Customer --> Checkout
  Checkout ..> : include Pay
  Coupon ..> : extend Checkout
  Clerk --> Refund
  Pay --- Gateway
  Clerk --|> Customer
  note for Clerk "Works in the back office"
  json Order@{ "id": 42, "items": ["book", "pen"] }
  Refund --> Order
